      "html": "<div class=\"ds-state\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 18\"><path d=\"M2 17V1\" stroke=\"#1d1a17\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"2.6\" y=\"1.5\" width=\"11\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1d1a17\"/><path d=\"M2.6 9.5V1.5L13.6 9.5z\" fill=\"#d4940a\" stroke=\"#1d1a17\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><b>Degraded</b><span>Diesel rationed</span></div>",
